  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 703.01 Inclusive Tax Calculation. When the tax is included in the price of taxable occupancies, as referenced in RSA 78-A:7, I(a), the tax shall be equal to 7.834% of such charge.\n\nSource. #2205, eff 12-12-82; ss by #2504, eff 10-12-83; ss by #3181, eff 1-22-86; ss by #4061, eff 5-29-86; ss by #5399, eff 5-21-92; ss by #6690, eff 2-21-98; ss by #6750, eff 5-19-98; ss by #7505, eff 6-19-01; ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
